  "title": "Diodes Incorporated Announces Retirement of Chairman Dr. Keh-Shew Lu and Election of Angie Chen Button as Chairwoman of the Board",
  "summary": "PLANO, Texas --(BUSINESS WIRE)--May 12, 2026-- Diodes Incorporated (Diodes) (Nasdaq: DIOD) today announced that Dr. Keh-Shew Lu has retired as Chairman of the Board of Directors, effective immediately, following more than 25 years of distinguished service to the Company.",
